# Fixture-backed happy path. The proxy fixture returns an available Montréal
# copy of the demonstration title and then walks the borrow from queued to
# complete, so this
# also drives the two-second poll and the progress drawn on the book itself.
clean
# Discover is the first screen now, and Search is on its own bar.
tap Search
wait-for Find a book
clean
tap Title, author, or ISBN
type potager
tap Search
wait-for Results
expect Results
clean
tap Le potager du fixture
wait-for Book details
expect Book details
expect Tapping one borrows
# Choosing the library is the borrow: no second screen, no second tap.
tap Montréal
wait-for Waiting to start
expect Book details
expect Le potager du fixture
clean
wait-for It is in your Library now
expect Open Library
expect Book details
clean
tap Open Library
wait-for My books
